{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken years later than planned, trapped deep inside a vast underground research facility. Once a volunteer for cryogenic testing, you now find yourself alone in an unknown place overrun by hostile machines and security systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth and adapt to survive in OBVERSE, an immersive first-person action, problem-solving, and exploration game where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/96b289b888b0e5834d9507f3e6d2811f.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=25 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years in cryostasis, you find yourself alone and disoriented. Piece together the story and your place in it by exploring your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/489a006a991659313d4bb777dc06d1fe.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security drones, combat bots, and automated defenses stalk the facility. Sneak past, disable, reprogram, or fight them. Every enemy encounter is a puzzle where direct combat is only one of the many possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9a141e518d8eb75f4799645e48b7a4d1.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector introduces new gameplay mechanics and reveals fragments of the mystery. Knowledge is your most valuable progression resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/caa14fb8f96c0fbb09269a14a7c02313.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect power, overload circuits, disable and reprogram robots, commandeer drones, repair devices. Find creative ways to exploit and interact with every system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended exploration and non-linear, knowledge-driven progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Systemic and emergent gameplay with focus on player choice and deep systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal hand-holding and player guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted, detailed environments with a unique blocky visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive design: minimal UI, diegetic interactions, atmospheric sound design.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028770?t=1761427143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/bdbed2657654701273e1e5752847bb131b7d31a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761427143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/57c6bbb6dd888085955330b258b544db774040a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761427143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/57c6bbb6dd888085955330b258b544db774040a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761427143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work. Strong language and general adult content mostly conveyed through text."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken years later than planned, trapped deep inside a vast underground research facility. Once a volunteer for cryogenic testing, you now find yourself alone in an unknown place overrun by hostile machines and security systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth and adapt to survive in OBVERSE, an immersive first-person action, problem-solving, and exploration game where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/96b289b888b0e5834d9507f3e6d2811f.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=25 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years in cryostasis, you find yourself alone and disoriented. Piece together the story and your place in it by exploring your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2949b2b045b3999a6df286b9713451c3.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/489a006a991659313d4bb777dc06d1fe.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security drones, combat bots, and automated defenses stalk the facility. Sneak past, disable, reprogram, or fight them. Every enemy encounter is a puzzle where direct combat is only one of the many possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9940600061d12971c10a51b4c458ea64.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9a141e518d8eb75f4799645e48b7a4d1.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector introduces new gameplay mechanics and reveals fragments of the mystery. Knowledge is your most valuable progression resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9aa5676ba31c1240a24764e4e962ae1d.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/caa14fb8f96c0fbb09269a14a7c02313.webp?t=1761427143\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect power, overload circuits, disable and reprogram robots, commandeer drones, repair devices. Find creative ways to exploit and interact with every system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.poster.avif?t=1761427143\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.webm?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/44cf790153fb67af343adba4ecfeb0fe.mp4?t=1761427143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended exploration and non-linear, knowledge-driven progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Systemic and emergent gameplay with focus on player choice and deep systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal hand-holding and player guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted, detailed environments with a unique blocky visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive design: minimal UI, diegetic interactions, atmospheric sound design.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Diego Spartano","Sebastian Spartano"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/7fecd65b42528af8a025a17605144fe50cdd3415/header.jpg?t=1761427143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028770/941925964/53cab8a7f7a3720b1634d904b3df4c970c98b2cc/1761248250/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761250152","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028770/941925964/53cab8a7f7a3720b1634d904b3df4c970c98b2cc/1761248250/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761250152","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028770/941925964/53cab8a7f7a3720b1634d904b3df4c970c98b2cc/1761248250/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761250152","id":257221819,"name":"OBVERSE | Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221819/7d7c46d957529b4f49ae3910aeea74fb9a13432e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761250152"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028770/1094429563/a81e85995797baa35568c36cf9d5d8171fbb16c9/1759086858/dash_a